TITLE Albite dissolution with H2S gas
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 10.0
        -steps 1000 in 100
USER_PUNCH
    -head step H2S_gas
    -start
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, GAS("H2S(g)")
    -end
END